  "review": [
    "No chorus field; 8/8/8. 1:5 \"في عياء\" rendered as a rushing torrent per the printed sense (\"ran in a torrent\"), not as weariness. 1:8 \"دوّامة\" as סְחַרְחֹרֶת (whirlpool/vortex). Glossary: מַחֲסֶה for مَلاذ, תַּאֲוָה for مُنى, פָּדָה for افتدى, חַבּוּרָה for جِراح with Isa 53:5 echo, צְעָדִים for خُطى. Short 1:6/2:5/2:7 and 3:6 kept proportional to the Arabic. The freedom/restoration refrain of 3:8 closes the hymn as in the Arabic."
  ]
